     - **Diethyl Ether (CH3-CH2-OCH2-CH3)**: An ether with two ethyl groups attached to the oxygen atom.  
     - **Diethyl Ether (CH3-CH2-OCH2-CH3)**: An ether with two ethyl groups attached to the oxygen atom.  

