\[
\mathcal{D}_a V^\mu = \frac{\partial V^\mu}{\partial x^a} + \mathcal{K_{ab}} \frac{\partial V^\mu}{\partial x^b}
\]
where \( \mathcal{K_{ab}} \) is the metric operator. 

