2. **Final Momentum:**
   After the cannonball is fired, it has a velocity \(v_{\text{cb}} = 90.0 \text{ m/s}\) and a mass \(m_{\text{cb}} = 1 \text{ kg}\). The Earth recoeds with a velocity \(v_{\text{e}}\) and a mass \(m_{\text{e}} = 5.97 \times 10^{24} \text{ kg}\). The total momentum after the firing is:
