   \[
   0 = m_{\text{cb}} v_{\text{cb}} + m_{\text{e}} v_{\text{e}}
   \]
   Solving for \(v_{\text{e}}\):
   \[
   v_{\text{e}} = -\frac{m_{\text{cb}} v_{\text{cb}}}{m_{\text{e}}}
