     \[
     h_1 = \frac{0.000001 \sqrt{C_p \rho_0 \rho_0}}{L} \left( \frac{C_p \rho_0 \rho_0}{L} \right)^{1/2}
     \]
   - The heat transfer coefficient for laminar flow over a flat plate is:
     \[
     h_1 = \frac{0.000001 \sqrt{C_p \rho_0 \rho_0}}{L} \left( \frac{C_p \rho_0 \rho_0}{L} \right)^{1/2}
